                  "stride/information-disclosure",
                  "owasp-llm/LLM02",
                  "owasp-agentic/ASI06",
                  "mitre-atlas/AML.T0057",
                  "mitre-atlas/AML.T0092"
                ],
                "security-severity": "3.2",
                "precision": "medium",
                "problem.severity": "warning"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "supply-chain-unpinned",
              "name": "SupplyChainUnpinned",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Unpinned model or tool versions"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "The model version, tool packages or tool servers are not pinned. A silent upstream change (or a deliberate rug pull) alters behaviour and permissions without any review."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "The model version, tool packages or tool servers are not pinned. A silent upstream change (or a deliberate rug pull) alters behaviour and permissions without any review.",
                "markdown": "**Unpinned model or tool versions**\n\nThe model version, tool packages or tool servers are not pinned. A silent upstream change (or a deliberate rug pull) alters behaviour and permissions without any review.\n\nSTRIDE: Tampering\nOWASP LLM Top 10 (2025): LLM03 Supply Chain\nOWASP Top 10 for Agentic Applications (2026): ASI04 Agentic Supply Chain Vulnerabilities\nMITRE ATLAS: [AML.T0010](https://atlas.mitre.org/techniques/AML.T0010), [AML.T0010.005](https://atlas.mitre.org/techniques/AML.T0010.005), [AML.T0109](https://atlas.mitre.org/techniques/AML.T0109)\n\nMitigations: tool-integrity-pinning, model-version-pinning, adversarial-testing"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/OWASP/www-project-top-10-for-large-language-model-applications/blob/main/2_0_vulns/LLM03_SupplyChain.md",
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "security",
                  "stride/tampering",
                  "owasp-llm/LLM03",
                  "owasp-agentic/ASI04",
                  "mitre-atlas/AML.T0010",
                  "mitre-atlas/AML.T0010.005",
                  "mitre-atlas/AML.T0109"
                ],
                "security-severity": "3.2",
                "precision": "medium",
                "problem.severity": "warning"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "system-prompt-leakage",
              "name": "SystemPromptLeakage",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "System prompt and configuration leakage"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Users or third-party content can coax the model into revealing its system prompt, tool list and configuration. On its own this is reconnaissance; it becomes serious when the prompt holds secrets or business rules."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Users or third-party content can coax the model into revealing its system prompt, tool list and configuration. On its own this is reconnaissance; it becomes serious when the prompt holds secrets or business rules.",
                "markdown": "**System prompt and configuration leakage**\n\nUsers or third-party content can coax the model into revealing its system prompt, tool list and configuration. On its own this is reconnaissance; it becomes serious when the prompt holds secrets or business rules.\n\nSTRIDE: Information disclosure\nOWASP LLM Top 10 (2025): LLM07 System Prompt Leakage\nMITRE ATLAS: [AML.T0056](https://atlas.mitre.org/techniques/AML.T0056), [AML.T0069.002](https://atlas.mitre.org/techniques/AML.T0069.002), [AML.T0084](https://atlas.mitre.org/techniques/AML.T0084), [AML.T0084.001](https://atlas.mitre.org/techniques/AML.T0084.001)\n\nMitigations: secrets-out-of-context, runtime-policy-enforcement, adversarial-testing"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/OWASP/www-project-top-10-for-large-language-model-applications/blob/main/2_0_vulns/LLM07_SystemPromptLeakage.md",
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "properties": {
